Each component documents: visual description, token references (always semantic or component tokens, never primitives), variants, states, and evidence grade.

## Token Reference Rules

- ✅ Reference semantic tokens: `color.action.primary`, `color.bg.surface`, `space.container.padding`
- ✅ Reference component tokens: `button.height.default`
- ❌ Do NOT reference primitive tokens directly: `color.blue.500`, `space.4`
- ❌ Do NOT use raw values: `#165DFF`, `16px`

